FFDA 6E9FDFC4         01373         SW2HND  JMP    [SW2VEC]
FFDE 6E9FDFC6         01374         FIRHND  JMP    [FIRVEC]        handlers to use soft vectors
FFE2 6E9FDFC8         01375         IRQHND  JMP    [IRQVEC]
FFE6 6E9FDFCA         01376         SWIHND  JMP    [SWIVEC]
FFEA 6E9FE40A         01377         NMIHND  JMP    [NMIVEC]
